WEBVTT

00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:10.011
(GRUNTING)

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:17.894
Whoa.

00:00:22.523 --> 00:00:23.524
(GASPS) Wait.

00:00:23.608 --> 00:00:25.234
It feels like it's still there.

00:00:25.318 --> 00:00:26.486
Yeah, that's called phantom tail.

00:00:26.569 --> 00:00:27.570
You'll get used to it.

00:00:28.279 --> 00:00:29.989
(GRUNTING)

00:00:30.072 --> 00:00:31.866
Right. Walking.

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:34.744
Don't worry, you're in luck.
I basically invented it.

00:00:34.911 --> 00:00:37.538
To start, stack everything
one on top of the other.

00:00:37.622 --> 00:00:39.207
Like a pile of rocks.

00:00:39.999 --> 00:00:41.292
(GRUNTING)

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:44.212
Great! I mean, fine, whatever.

00:00:44.295 --> 00:00:46.422
Now, walking is just like swimming.

00:00:46.506 --> 00:00:48.382
But without fins. Or a tail.

00:00:48.466 --> 00:00:49.592
And also, there's no water.

00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:51.385
Otherwise, it's like the exact same thing.

00:00:51.469 --> 00:00:52.595
Give it a try.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:54.555
(STRUGGLES AND GRUNTS)

00:00:54.639 --> 00:00:55.806
That's not it. Try it again.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:57.141
(GRUNTS)

00:00:57.225 --> 00:00:59.560
Oh, try to lead with your head.

00:00:59.644 --> 00:01:01.229
No, more belly.

00:01:03.231 --> 00:01:05.149
That's... That's lying on the ground.

00:01:05.233 --> 00:01:06.234
How about this?

00:01:06.317 --> 00:01:08.277
Just take a step without
even thinking about it.

00:01:08.361 --> 00:01:10.029
No, no, no, don't think about it.

00:01:10.112 --> 00:01:12.031
I don't know how to
not think about something.

00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:14.408
(GROANS) Okay, okay. Watch.

00:01:14.492 --> 00:01:16.452
Point your feet to where
you wanna go. Okay?

00:01:16.536 --> 00:01:18.663
And then you just catch yourself

00:01:18.746 --> 00:01:19.747
before you fall.

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:23.918
Yeah, that's right.

00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:26.170
(WHIMPERS)

00:01:26.462 --> 00:01:27.463
Heh.

00:01:29.257 --> 00:01:31.008
-Good. Good.
-(CHUCKLING)

00:01:31.092 --> 00:01:33.553
-Yes. Yes!
-I'm... I'm getting it!

00:01:34.387 --> 00:01:36.931
Not bad, kid. Alberto Scorfano.

00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:38.015
Luca Paguro.

00:01:38.099 --> 00:01:40.268
(GREETS IN ITALIAN)

00:01:40.977 --> 00:01:43.521
It's a human thing. I'm kind of an expert.

00:01:43.604 --> 00:01:45.022
What does it mean?

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:47.608
The thing you just said?

00:01:47.775 --> 00:01:49.735
Come on. I'll show you some more stuff!

00:01:51.571 --> 00:01:53.072
Mother-of-pearl!

00:01:53.698 --> 00:01:54.699
You live up here?

00:01:54.782 --> 00:01:56.075
Yeah. Me and my dad.

00:01:56.159 --> 00:01:57.243
He's not even here a whole lot,

00:01:57.326 --> 00:01:58.911
so I pretty much just do whatever I want.

00:01:58.995 --> 00:02:00.121
Isn't it dangerous?

00:02:00.204 --> 00:02:01.414
Yeah, it's the best!

00:02:01.497 --> 00:02:03.291
Everything good is above the surface.

00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:05.501
Like, what else?

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.211
Air! (INHALES DEEPLY)

00:02:07.295 --> 00:02:08.462
(INHALES AND GAGS)

00:02:08.546 --> 00:02:09.630
(COUGHS)

00:02:10.047 --> 00:02:12.383
Gravity! Also known as falling!

00:02:12.466 --> 00:02:13.676
(GRUNTING)

00:02:14.886 --> 00:02:17.680
The sky. Clouds. The sun.

00:02:17.972 --> 00:02:19.724
Whoa. Don't look at it.

00:02:19.807 --> 00:02:21.517
Just kidding. Definitely look at it.

00:02:21.601 --> 00:02:22.602
(GROANS)

00:02:23.102 --> 00:02:25.980
And then, there's human stuff.

00:02:29.317 --> 00:02:30.401
Whoa.

00:02:31.444 --> 00:02:32.445
As you can see,

00:02:32.528 --> 00:02:34.322
I've been collecting for a long time,

00:02:34.405 --> 00:02:35.406
so ask me anything.

00:02:36.282 --> 00:02:37.366
(GASPS)

00:02:37.992 --> 00:02:39.535
-Whoa. (ECHOES)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:02:39.619 --> 00:02:42.038
Yes. That's the Magic
Singing Lady Machine.

00:02:42.205 --> 00:02:44.540
It's broken, unfortunately.

00:02:44.624 --> 00:02:46.042
(WOMAN SINGING ARIA
OVER GRAMOPHONE)

00:02:46.125 --> 00:02:48.503
Whoa! You unbroke it!

00:02:48.586 --> 00:02:50.755
(OPERATIC MUSIC CONTINUES)

00:02:52.924 --> 00:02:53.925
(GASPS)

00:02:58.095 --> 00:02:59.096
LUCA: What's that?

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:02.183
Oh, it's just the greatest thing
that humans ever made.

00:03:02.266 --> 00:03:03.601
The Vespa.

00:03:03.684 --> 00:03:05.561
-Whoa.
-You just sit on it,

00:03:05.645 --> 00:03:07.522
and it takes you anywhere you wanna go.

00:03:07.605 --> 00:03:09.315
In the whole stinkin' world!

00:03:09.398 --> 00:03:10.691
(GASPS)

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.444
LUCA: "Vespa is freedom."

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.281
Huh?

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:19.534
(LAUGHING)

00:03:19.617 --> 00:03:21.619
(SOFT WHIMSICAL MUSIC PLAYING)

00:03:21.702 --> 00:03:22.703
Whoo-hoo-hoo.

00:03:22.787 --> 00:03:23.996
Yeah!

00:03:25.414 --> 00:03:26.415
(GASPS)

00:03:26.499 --> 00:03:27.500
ALBERTO: Pretty cool, right?

00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:30.336
(GRUNTS) Uh... Yeah.

00:03:31.754 --> 00:03:33.923
Huh. Are you gonna make one?

00:03:34.006 --> 00:03:35.842
I think you have all the parts.

00:03:36.759 --> 00:03:38.344
I do have the parts.

00:03:38.427 --> 00:03:40.471
I am gonna make one! You wanna help?

00:03:40.555 --> 00:03:44.225
Me? Yeah! Wait! No, I can't.

00:03:44.308 --> 00:03:46.185
-I gotta go home.
-Right this second?

00:03:46.269 --> 00:03:48.563
Yeah, if my parents found out
I was up here...

00:03:48.646 --> 00:03:50.022
Oof. (CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:03:50.106 --> 00:03:52.733
It would be bad. So, thank you, but...

00:03:55.069 --> 00:03:57.572
Goodbye. Forever.

00:04:00.575 --> 00:04:03.661
Okay, but now, I really do have to go.

00:04:03.744 --> 00:04:04.871
Okay. Bye.

00:04:06.664 --> 00:04:09.584
Seriously, I have to go,
like, now. Like, right now.

00:04:09.667 --> 00:04:10.918
Okay. See ya.

00:04:12.628 --> 00:04:13.754
(GASPS IN AWE)

00:04:13.838 --> 00:04:15.506
It's even better than the picture.

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:16.591
Yeah, it is.

00:04:17.175 --> 00:04:18.926
(GASPS) Gotta run.

00:04:19.468 --> 00:04:20.761
ALBERTO: See ya tomorrow!

00:04:26.601 --> 00:04:28.227
Luca! Where have you been?

00:04:28.311 --> 00:04:29.312
Uh...

00:04:29.395 --> 00:04:31.105
LUCA: Don't say surface.
Don't say surface.

00:04:31.189 --> 00:04:32.565
Surface. (GASPS)

00:04:32.648 --> 00:04:34.484
What did you just say?

00:04:34.567 --> 00:04:35.568
What's wrong with your foot?

00:04:35.651 --> 00:04:36.861
(GASPS AND SCREAMS)

00:04:36.944 --> 00:04:37.945
DANIELA: Luca.

00:04:38.738 --> 00:04:41.240
-Oh, I... I...
-Gonna tell us where you were?

00:04:41.616 --> 00:04:43.493
-Uh...
-It's my fault.

00:04:43.576 --> 00:04:45.411
I sent him to look for sea cucumbers.

00:04:45.495 --> 00:04:48.414
Right! Sorry, Grandma,
I couldn't find them.

00:04:48.498 --> 00:04:49.707
DANIELA: Mom, his life is

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:51.876
maybe a little more important
than your snacks.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:53.920
(WHISPERS) Thank you.

00:04:54.504 --> 00:04:55.963
(GIGGLES)

00:04:57.006 --> 00:04:58.424
(EXHALES DEEPLY)

00:05:01.219 --> 00:05:02.845
Whoa! How'd you get it down?

00:05:03.012 --> 00:05:04.096
I rode it down.

00:05:05.848 --> 00:05:07.642
-Uh...
-I didn't.

00:05:07.725 --> 00:05:09.894
But I pushed it out the back window.

00:05:09.977 --> 00:05:11.479
Took a while to put back together,

00:05:11.562 --> 00:05:12.647
but it's fine now.

00:05:13.397 --> 00:05:14.607
You ready to ride it?

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:15.691
(GASPS)

00:05:15.775 --> 00:05:17.401
(SINISTER MUSIC PLAYS)

00:05:18.069 --> 00:05:21.906
Oh, well, thank you, but no thank you.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:24.492
I mean, I just think maybe I would die.

00:05:24.659 --> 00:05:27.245
Okay, I'll ride it. You hold the ramp.

00:05:27.328 --> 00:05:28.329
LUCA: Uh...

00:05:28.412 --> 00:05:29.664
(STRAINING)

00:05:29.747 --> 00:05:32.375
Sir, maybe we should sleep on it?

00:05:32.458 --> 00:05:34.919
ALBERTO: Whatever you do, do not move!

00:05:35.002 --> 00:05:36.504
I'm not the guy you want for this.

00:05:36.587 --> 00:05:37.630
I'm more of an idea man...

00:05:37.713 --> 00:05:39.757
Take me, gravity!

00:05:42.677 --> 00:05:43.970
Um...

00:05:44.053 --> 00:05:45.304
Ouch! (WHIMPERS)

00:05:45.388 --> 00:05:47.014
This is normal! Stay focused!

00:05:47.098 --> 00:05:48.140
(GASPS)

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.185
-(GRUNTING)
-(LUCA WHIMPERS)

00:05:51.269 --> 00:05:52.478
Don't move, don't move, don't move!

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.730
(GRUNTS, SHUDDERS)

00:05:54.814 --> 00:05:55.940
(ALBERTO YELPS)

00:05:57.525 --> 00:05:59.902
(GASPS) He's dead. I killed him!

00:06:00.444 --> 00:06:02.071
Whoo-hoo! (LAUGHS)

00:06:02.155 --> 00:06:03.865
-Wait. That was good?
-ALBERTO: Oh, my...

00:06:03.948 --> 00:06:06.033
Did you see the height I got?

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.785
Hey, nice ramping.

00:06:07.952 --> 00:06:09.453
Come on, let's build another one.

00:06:09.537 --> 00:06:11.789
(UPBEAT ITALIAN POP MUSIC PLAYING)

00:06:13.875 --> 00:06:15.126
(GRUNTING)

00:06:17.044 --> 00:06:18.045
(GRUNTS)

00:06:20.882 --> 00:06:21.883
(CHUCKLES)

00:06:21.966 --> 00:06:24.260
(UPBEAT ITALIAN POP MUSIC CONTINUES)

00:06:25.052 --> 00:06:26.137
ALBERTO: Yahoo!

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:27.680
-(SEAGULL SQUAWKS)
-(YELPS)

00:06:28.389 --> 00:06:29.932
Huh? Huh?

00:06:30.683 --> 00:06:32.059
Ow. (GRUNTS)

00:06:32.143 --> 00:06:33.144
(GRUNTS)

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:35.188
-(SQUAWKS)
-ALBERTO: Ha-ha!

00:06:35.271 --> 00:06:37.273
(UPBEAT ITALIAN POP MUSIC CONTINUES)

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:39.901
(ALBERTO LAUGHING)

00:06:39.984 --> 00:06:41.360
Whoo-hoo!

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:44.238
Come on, Luca!

00:06:46.282 --> 00:06:48.284
Whoa! (SCREAMING)

00:06:56.125 --> 00:06:57.793
(UPBEAT ITALIAN POP MUSIC CONTINUES)

00:07:05.092 --> 00:07:06.219
-(SQUEAKING)
-Huh.

00:07:12.266 --> 00:07:13.267
(ENGINE ROARS)

00:07:13.351 --> 00:07:15.895
What's wrong with you, stupido?

00:07:17.563 --> 00:07:20.024
(ECHOES) What's wrong with you, stupido?

